        "Content": "de Courcy Estate Agents are delighted to offer for sale this first floor 2 bedroomed apartment in a complex of 8 apartments (two blocks of 4).  Superbly positioned within the exclusive and highly sought after Beechwood Court development just off the Golf Links Road  and only 300 metres from Castletroy Club House.  Close to a range of amenities on your doorstep including the University of Limerick, Plassey Technological Park, Castletroy Golf Club, shopping centres, excellent schools, and a wide selection of cafés, restaurants, gyms and leisure facilities. This apartment is on an elevated site with beautiful views of Limerick city.  \r\nViewing highly recommended. \r\n\r\nContact : Richard de Courcy – 087 2535740\r\n\r\n\r\nProperty Features\r\n\r\n•\tSouthwest facing balcony.\r\n\r\n•\tDual Aspect Apartment\r\n\r\n•\tDistinguished Address\r\n\r\n•\tOpen Plan living / dining room\r\n\r\n•\tFitted wardrobes in Bedrooms\r\n\r\n•\tDouble Glazed PVC Windows\r\n\r\n•\tExclusive small development of 8 apartments\r\n\r\n•\tEstablished and hugely popular location. \r\n\r\n•\tPrivate parking (1 space)\r\n\r\n\r\nACCOMMODATION:\r\n\r\nHallway:  Hotpress and entrance to attic.\r\n\r\nLiving room: 5.7m. x 4.8m. \r\nFireplace with gas fire (not connected) \r\nSliding aluminium doors to balcony with views overlooking Beechwood and Limerick City Centre. \r\nSouthwest facing balcony.\r\n\t\r\nKitchen:  2.9m. x 2.7m.  \r\nSink Unit with presses and drawers and eye level presses.\r\nIncluding appliances.\r\n\r\nBedroom 1:    5m x 2.7m.  \r\n2 x double built in wardrobes\r\n\t\r\nBedroom 2:    2.6m.  x  3.5m.  \r\nDouble & single built in wardrobes.\r\n\r\nBath & Toilet:\r\n\r\n\r\nHEATING:          Electric heating\r\n\r\nWINDOWS:       PVC double glazed windows\r\n\r\nAGE:                 1985\r\n\r\nBER:                 E\r\n\r\nFLOOR AREA:    72.85 sq. m.\r\n\r\nINCLUDED:       Carpets, curtains, light fittings and appliances.\r\n\r\n\r\nSERVICE CHARGE:\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nVIEWING:  By appointment with Estate Agents\r\n-----------------------------------------------------------\r\nThese particulars are issued by de Courcy Estate Agents on the understanding that any \r\nnegotiations relating to the property are conducted through them. While every care \r\nis taken in preparing them, de Courcy Estate Agents, for themselves and for the \r\nvendor/lessor whose agents they are, give notice that: (1) The particulars are\r\n set out as general outline for guiding potential but must satisfy themselves \r\n(at their own expense) as their correctness. (3) Neither de Courcy Estate Agents\r\n or any of its employees have any authority to make any or give any \r\nrepresentation or warranty in relation to the property."
